A line block takes a lazy line whatever its last payload line

````
> ::: |
> ```
> x
after
.
<blockquote>
  <div class="line-block">
    <p><code>
x
after</code></p>
  </div>
</blockquote>
````

```
> ::: |
> # h
> x
after
.
<blockquote>
  <div class="line-block">
    <p># h<br>
x<br>
after</p>
  </div>
</blockquote>
```
